    "intro_narrative": "The rain beats relentlessly against the frosted windows of Silas Vance's abandoned office. You, a seasoned detective, have finally tracked the infamous corporate embezzler down to this hidden, makeshift laboratory. The air smells faintly of ozone and stale coffee. Vance was deeply paranoid, leaving his most damning secrets scattered across various devices and encrypted systems. Your primary objective is clear: retrieve the final piece of evidence locked away in his heavily secured container. But Vance didn't make it easy. You'll need to piece together scattered blueprints, verify suspicious financial trails, and manipulate his own experimental technology against him. The clock is ticking before his associates arrive to scrub the place clean. Search the room, utilize the abandoned investigative tools, and uncover the truth.",
